<title>USA: Bassett CEO to retire; new CEO sought.</title>
<headline>Bassett CEO to retire; new CEO sought.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bassett Furniture Industries Inc said Friday that Robert Spilman, its chairman and chief executive, will retire May 1.</p>
<p>Bassett said it has formed a search committee and retained an executive recruitment firm to find a successor.</p>
<p>Spilman has been at Bassett for 40 years after joining in 1957 as a sales manager in the table division, the company said.</p>
